BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Laclede Pershing Days Car Show this September. The event is schedu
 led for Sat.
DTSTART:20260912T133000Z
DTEND:20260912T143000Z
DTSTAMP:20260815T014139Z
UID:leadereditorial-2026-09-12-laclede-pershing-days-car-show-this-septemb
 er-the-event-is-s-2026-09-12-830@linn-county-scraper.local
DESCRIPTION:Laclede Pershing Days Car Show this September. The event is sc
 heduled for Sat.\, Sept. 12\, at Laclede City Park. Registration will begi
 n in the morning\, with the show taking place from 8:30 a.m. to 12:30 p.m.
  The entry fee is $10 per vehicle. The annual event is part of the Laclede
  Pershing Days celebration and offers visitors the chance to admire a wide
  range of restored classics\, custom builds\, vintage tractors and motorcy
 cles while enjoying one of the community’s signature festivals. For more
  information about the car show\, contact Blake Crawford at 660-973-7653 o
 r Kasarah Crawford at 660-734-4401.
LOCATION:Laclede\, MO
END:VEVENT
